      <p>
        This portfolio presents my interest in IT systems programming:
        understanding how software, data, and user interfaces work together
        to solve real problems.
      </p>
      <p>
        I enjoy turning requirements into structured applications, learning
        new technologies, and improving solutions through testing and feedback.
      </p>
      <a href="/projects" class="btn">See Programming Examples</a>
